Holaquetal 




I've created a standalone GUI application using Python's built-in tkinter library. Here's what the application offers:

A simple graphical interface for easy file selection and key input
Secure key generation using SHA-256 hashing
File encryption using XOR operation with the generated key
Base64 encoding of encrypted data to ensure safe file storage
Ability to decrypt files using the same key
Error handling and user feedback
Support for any file type (not just text files)
